  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 74c47e3a0cf4baa409a657f200a9f294, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GJ.Game.ReadableNote
  text: 'DAY 9


    The boiler room. The bolt on the

    door runs on steam: water
    in the

    pot, the relief valve shut, and a

    flame under it.


    The
    only flame I have is the one

    in my hand. It boils slower than

    I can
    hold my breath.'
